{
  "about": "What is kept between launches has an owner, written beside the list of pages: the person, or the visitor, the pages were answered for. A kept page may be read only when this launch's shell has answered over the network as a shell and named that owner, whatever order the answers come in. An answer that is not a shell names nobody and makes nothing readable; a kept list with no owner, or whose kept shell does not read, is emptied, not taken.",
